+# Product release evidence
+
+This scaffold starts with no observed task states or product completion records.
+All P01–P19 rows and all 64 feature registry items remain open. The empty
+`readiness.json` is an inventory, not release evidence.
+
+See [the checker contract](../../../tools/release_readiness/README.md) for input
+format, commands, exit codes and limitations. Store reviewed actual-data,
+actual-screen and release artifacts here. Checker regression logs belong under
+`tools/evidence/`; they do not close product rows or complete T-OP-08.
